{
  "sn45.12:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 45.12 ",
  "sn45.12:0.2": "2. Vihāravagga ",
  "sn45.12:0.3": "Dutiyavihārasutta ",
  "sn45.12:1.1": "Sāvatthinidānaṁ. ",
  "sn45.12:1.2": "“Icchāmahaṁ, bhikkhave, temāsaṁ paṭisallīyituṁ. ",
  "sn45.12:1.3": "Namhi kenaci upasaṅkamitabbo, aññatra ekena piṇḍapātanīhārakenā”ti. ",
  "sn45.12:1.4": "“Evaṁ, bhante”ti kho te bhikkhū bhagavato paṭissutvā nāssudha koci bhagavantaṁ upasaṅkamati, aññatra ekena piṇḍapātanīhārakena. ",
  "sn45.12:2.1": "Atha kho bhagavā tassa temāsassa accayena paṭisallānā vuṭṭhito bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "sn45.12:2.2": "“yena svāhaṁ, bhikkhave, vihārena paṭhamābhisambuddho viharāmi, tassa padesena vihāsiṁ. ",
  "sn45.12:2.3": "So evaṁ pajānāmi: ",
  "sn45.12:2.4": "‘micchādiṭṭhipaccayāpi vedayitaṁ; ",
  "sn45.12:2.5": "micchādiṭṭhivūpasamapaccayāpi vedayitaṁ; ",
  "sn45.12:2.6": "sammādiṭṭhipaccayāpi vedayitaṁ; ",
  "sn45.12:2.7": "sammādiṭṭhivūpasamapaccayāpi vedayitaṁ …pe… ",
  "sn45.12:2.8": "micchāsamādhipaccayāpi vedayitaṁ; ",
  "sn45.12:2.9": "micchāsamādhivūpasamapaccayāpi vedayitaṁ, sammāsamādhipaccayāpi vedayitaṁ; ",
  "sn45.12:2.10": "sammāsamādhivūpasamapaccayāpi vedayitaṁ; ",
  "sn45.12:2.11": "chandapaccayāpi vedayitaṁ; ",
  "sn45.12:2.12": "chandavūpasamapaccayāpi vedayitaṁ; ",
  "sn45.12:2.13": "vitakkapaccayāpi vedayitaṁ; ",
  "sn45.12:2.14": "vitakkavūpasamapaccayāpi vedayita�